{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/57acga","slideIndex":7,"text":"In these examples, I can hear the corrected pitch and see the eighth note restored in the score. Comparing the edited file with the reference makes each change easy to inspect.\n\nThe D4-to-E4 error shows a different outcome: the correct answer is among the candidates, but the first choice changes the intended pitch. That's why I display both the prediction and its alternatives.\n\nSources (not spoken)\nLocal examples: ml/demo/inference_demo; context v3 validation prediction index 57."}
